          "settings": {
            "title": "What other supplements work synergistically with this product?",
            "text": "<p>Foundational Multivitamin, D3 + K2, and EPA/DHA provide essential nutrients that support overall wellness and cellular repair. NAC + Glycine and Rejuvenate UA can offer comprehensive cell rejuvenation, mitochondrial support and inflammation balancing - forming an advanced healthy aging stack.</p>"
